# Binary files git must not "helpfully" convert line endings in.
#
# This machine checks out with CRLF, and without these rules git treats a PDF
# or a PNG as text: every 0x0A inside the file becomes 0x0D 0x0A on checkout and
# the file is corrupt. It committed fine, it just cannot be opened again.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.3mf   binary
*.stl   binary
*.glb   binary
